OL,3,GNEWSAStorm Boleo sees trains cancelled
OL,4,Aand fallen trees
OL,5,
OL,6,FRailway services have been disrupted
OL,7,Fand power cut off as Storm Boleo has
OL,8,Fbrought high winds and power outages
OL,9,Facross the West Midlands.
OL,11,FWest Midlands Railway trains between
OL,12,FFour Oaks, Birmingham, and Lichfield
OL,13,FTrent Valley, Staffordshire, were
OL,14,Fcancelled in both directions due to a
OL,15,Fdowned tree. The line has since
OL,16,Freopened but delays are still expected.
OL,18,FTransport for Wales services between
OL,19,FCardiff and Shrewsbury have been
OL,20,Fcancelled, and disruption has been
OL,21,Freported between Aberystwyth and
OL,22,FShrewsbury.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
